source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: The hidden `}}` stays inside the body and the span closes at the later one; jiro pairs the same braces and keeps the legacy reading of one literal backslash where Jira renders a forced newline.
-- input.jira --
{{a\\}}b}}
-- rendered.html --
<p><tt>a<br class="atl-forced-newline" />}}b</tt></p>
-- want.md --
`a\}}b`
-- warnings.json --
[]
